{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo summons his pact weapon, and casts light on it. The prismatic colors shimmering from his weapon amplify. As it floats in front of him horizontally, he places the crystal on its hilt. Almlst like a center jewel. Positioned in a way to refract the light up onto the ceiling.","created_at":"2021-07-30T07:31:18.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870569230280589323","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
